# Stable spec ID: punch-sherry-cobbler. Source checked 2026-10-13. Machine generated; not human reviewed or taste-tested.

::ingredients
(sherry; amontillado) 3 1/2 oz
(simple syrup) 1/2 oz
(orange, sliced) 2-3 slices

::equipment
(muddler)
(cocktail shaker)
(highball glass, Collins)

::instructions
(orange) + (simple syrup) <muddle, in (cocktail shaker)>
(sherry) <add, with ice> <shake>
<strain, into (highball glass, Collins) filled with crushed ice>
<garnish, with a lemon wheel and seasonal berries and mint>
<serve, with a straw>

::notes
This records one source-specific version; no universal formula or automatic product substitution is implied.
OSF uses the shaker for the muddling step to avoid transferring the mixture from the source mixing glass. Source formula and proportions remain unchanged.

